<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">Dear Valued Customer,</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">&nbsp;</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">The management of Oceanic Heritage Trust Bank wishes to inform you that arrangements are underway to release your outstanding funds sum of $4,000,000 via ATM card delivery.</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">&nbsp;</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">The delivery charge is $450. Please verify the fee and payment procedure through our official customer service channels before making payment. Tracking details will be provided once delivery is confirmed.</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">&nbsp;</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">Kindly provide the following details through a secure, verified channel:</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">&nbsp;</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">Full name for the ATM card</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">Residential delivery address</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">Contact telephone number</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">Thank you for your cooperation.</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">&nbsp;</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">Yours faithfully,</font></div>
<div>
<font size="4" face="Bahnschrift SemiLight">Paul Johnson Phil</font></div>
